-- title:
--   Homogeneous coefficients for homogeneous ideal membership
-- statement:
--   If a weighted homogeneous polynomial of degree E belongs to the ideal generated by polynomials all of degree D, it has an ideal representation with every coefficient weighted homogeneous of degree E − D.
